# Cloudflare Pages response headers for commons.ae (build output = commons/).
# No page may be shown inside another site's frame: a hostile page could overlay a hidden
# Accept / Remove / Delete tap (security reviews PR #31 + T5.2 PR B). A <meta> CSP can't
# carry frame-ancestors, so it has to be a header. The github.io copy can't set headers;
# canonical.js forwards it to commons.ae.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
